@pat.kids.arith.w.give.f1 core.pattern
    match="{who:agent} [just|then|also|already|later|again|quickly|kindly]? [gives|gave|give|handed|hands|passed|passes|pass|sent|sends|send|lent|lends|donated|donates|offered|offers|tossed|threw|throws|brings|brought|delivers|delivered|presented|hands_over|handed_over|passed_over|slid|slides] {to:agent} {n:number} [more]? {item:lex.kids.arith.items}"
